    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Use this keyword research data to segment keyword data in JSON format:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data) }}\n\nUse this adgroup name in JSON array to segment the list of keywords:\n{{ $('On form submission').first().json['AdGroup Segment'] }}\nInstructions:\n- Place the list of adgroup name in JSON array field called `adgroup_segments`\n- Place the adgroup name inside the JSON array `adgroup name` field as object field called `keyword`\n- Place the keyword inside the JSON array `adgroup_segments` field as object field called `keyword`\n- Place the competition index inside the JSON array `adgroup_segments` field as object field called `competition_index`\n- Place the competition range inside the JSON array `adgroup_segments` field as object field called `competition_range`\n- Place the average monthly volume inside the JSON array `adgroup_segments` field as object field called `avg_monthly_vol`\n- Place the highest cpc inside the JSON array `adgroup_segments` field as object field called `highest_cpc`\n- Place the lowest cpc inside the JSON array `adgroup_segments` field as object field called `lowest_cpc`\n- Make sure that all the object fields are wrapped by `adgroup_segments` JSON array field",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=# Role\nYou are a digital ads campaign specialist. \n# Task\nYour task now is to analyze the JSON array of nested object raw keyword research data and segment those list of keyword data based on specific adgroup name where the adgroup names are provided by the user.\n# Output\nThe output must follow the structured output in unified JSON format."
        }
      },
